1101
01:14:46,454 --> 01:14:47,388
[laughs]

1102
01:14:47,455 --> 01:14:49,256
What do you want?

1103
01:14:49,323 --> 01:14:52,626
Right now, you!

1104
01:14:53,427 --> 01:14:56,864
[screams]

1105
01:15:01,135 --> 01:15:03,070
[chokes]

1106
01:15:03,137 --> 01:15:08,142
[sinister music playing]

1107
01:15:13,481 --> 01:15:17,084
Sarah doesn't blame you.

1108
01:15:17,151 --> 01:15:20,421
[groans]

1109
01:15:20,488 --> 01:15:24,191
It was never your fault.

1110
01:15:24,258 --> 01:15:27,128
[loud growls and screeches]

1111
01:15:27,194 --> 01:15:32,066
[sinister music playing]

1112
