What's happening?

1122
01:16:33,360 --> 01:16:37,665
[Evelyn] I'm sorry.
It has to be this way.

1123
01:16:38,866 --> 01:16:40,935
What are you doing?

1124
01:16:44,872 --> 01:16:48,876
The only way is if it dies
inside a living vessel.

1125
01:16:53,080 --> 01:16:55,349
