while it's weak.

1126
01:16:56,450 --> 01:16:58,686
Or before I forget.

1127
01:17:00,855 --> 01:17:01,989
[Julia] Please.

1128
01:17:02,056 --> 01:17:04,191
[laughs]

1129
01:17:04,258 --> 01:17:09,897
You have been the answer
to all my prayers.

1130
01:17:12,766 --> 01:17:15,537
[screams]

1131
01:17:15,604 --> 01:17:16,605
No!

1132
01:17:16,704 --> 01:17:18,205
[groans]

1133
01:17:18,272 --> 01:17:19,940
[screams]

1134
01:17:20,007 --> 01:17:23,310
Please, don't kill me!

1135
01:17:23,377 --> 01:17:25,212
[entity]
Not again!

1136
01:17:28,382 --> 01:17:31,385
[screaming]

1137
