[Evelyn shushing]

1138
01:17:34,221 --> 01:17:35,557
[entity]
No!

1139
01:17:35,624 --> 01:17:37,424
Please, stop!

1140
01:17:37,491 --> 01:17:40,728
[screaming]

1141
01:17:42,930 --> 01:17:45,199
[Sarah]
Please, don't!

1142
01:17:46,734 --> 01:17:48,570
[entity]
Please, don't kill me!

1143
01:17:48,637 --> 01:17:50,539
Help me!

1144
01:17:50,605 --> 01:17:52,106
[shushes]

1145
01:17:52,907 --> 01:17:55,409
[Sarah]
Mommy!

1146
01:17:56,310 --> 01:17:59,313
Help! Please, help!

1147
01:17:59,847 --> 01:18:02,116
[Sarah]
Help! Please, help!

1148
01:18:03,017 --> 01:18:05,419
Mommy, please help!

1149
01:18:05,486 --> 01:18:09,223
[entity]
