1163
01:19:09,383 --> 01:19:11,720
<i>-♪ Precious name ♪</i>
<i>-♪ Precious name ♪</i>

1164
01:19:11,819 --> 01:19:14,723
<i>-♪ Oh, how sweet ♪</i>
<i>-♪ Oh, how sweet ♪</i>

1165
01:19:14,822 --> 01:19:18,560
<i>♪ Hope of Earth</i>
<i>and joy of Heav'n... ♪</i>

1166
01:19:18,627 --> 01:19:21,061
